[I] Modern alternative to libpng

[T] libspng (simple png) is a C library for reading and writing Portable
[T] Network Graphics files with a focus on security and ease of use. It is
[T] an alternative to libpng with a simpler, incompatible API and
[T] outperforms the reference implementation in common use cases.

[U] https://github.com/randy408/libspng

